  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v8-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "10cad651e33cf78ba3c35b989943af09ca92b6b6929a7f6a059f9b1282dc6cf4",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5e75544c8fa2647bc3ae2780ffe9a88d8cd7bd5108c05e8a852e20ecca81953d",
      "text": "悟空的\n小番茄",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "441e05b7016c30424ab16997c709ed4010f315addf2bc0a053ae58fe42429951",
      "text": "悟空家门口，\n有块阳光暖暖的小空地。\n“我们来种小番茄吧！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d26f017816adc540a363848fe1a290a4cab5c428ca8a95c817fde635f4a061fc",
      "text": "敖丙带来两棵小苗。\n他们挖了两个小坑。\n“你种一棵，我种一棵！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2589343d70d2f44c84b2411553fbb3af49662c1bd6d5d9a5e3af178d08340e4d",
      "text": "把小苗放进坑里，盖好土。\n悟空拍拍土，\n又拍拍自己的小肚子。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2dac4945467465f58b09e935d265ab910ee212f4c5d5ca9367eb513efb8f57be",
      "text": "悟空提起小水壶。\n“小苗，喝水喽！”\n哎呀，先把鞋子浇湿了！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "085c1d1b6e47f2abfc6691d55363103f34ca543c24aeeb64153378d42c81189d",
      "text": "敖丙变出一朵小云。\n滴答滴答，小雨落下来。\n“这回，小苗喝到水啦！”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "58575bf4a69450a97ea1a802d72c8d668c54f203d588d68bfd8ec749884ae018",
      "text": "每天，他们都摸摸泥土。\n土干了？浇一点水。\n土湿湿的？放心去玩吧！\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94aa2ae1413e2ef477be0b5751d4ad3b03afb732d733f607306da960566fe3f7",
      "text": "“红了吗？”悟空问。\n他在每片叶子下面找呀找。\n敖丙指指他的小鼻子，笑了。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d1556d30b71dd216b193f514decd931795d400a62f75770ad975a3ddf92a5c1",
      "text": "一天天过去了。\n小黄花开了。\n“你好呀，小星星！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9614f0a0b77eed1b4bda617de5673771a29e1fecb9cbab84fda791d96a395f51",
      "text": "接着，长出绿绿的小番茄。\n“熟了吗？”悟空问。\n“还没有呢。”敖丙说。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9d49640db8dc3749d1eefc2f195b5a9cef3e2df6c80d8a425d56690e271f6384",
      "text": "悟空小声说：\n“请变红吧。”\n番茄静悄悄的，\n一声也不吭。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4cfe7b62aeb29035b99db0ffabc811e76f06cb36c6fee6047ccbd50b67c2573d",
      "text": "浇浇水，等一等。\n绿的变黄，黄的变橙。\n“就快熟啦！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e7a8e526d9a5a377d6bb9fbba4c14f4b7e4714d2194f39cffc190abc60f0c26",
      "text": "一天早上，番茄红啦！\n红得亮晶晶的。\n悟空乐得跳起舞来。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "544992db13a3ffedfa92859993538ce27675ab8ef3a58f5a430f9a55da87a71b",
      "text": "轻轻一拧，往上一提。\n红番茄摘下来啦！\n绿番茄留着继续长。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b3f60c43a159f030ce25deddf7e50a9e1300b5e1f34b7607df1fa7fd64d85e44",
      "text": "他们洗净刚摘的小番茄。\n红红的番茄，凉凉的水。\n“现在可以尝尝啦！”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37262808be67969e62033c934b9524d433f379dfa8cd4010784b2435f92cba6c",
      "text": "他们分着吃小番茄。\n“这是我们种的！”悟空说。\n敖丙笑了：“我们一起种的。”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
